        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 9700, Gate Double Acting Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDouble Acting Spring Hinge for Gates and Screen Doors. Door flange is surface applied to door. Jamb flange is surface applied to door jamb. For doors up to 1-1/8\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer 9700 Double Acting Spring Hinges permit doors to open in either direction and automatically return to the closed position. \r\nPackaged  with #7 x 3/4\" wood mounting screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer 9700 Gate Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Size: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Non-Adjustable Tension</li>\r\n<li>Door flange surface applied</li>\r\n<li>Jamb flange surface applied</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Up To 1-1/8\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Max. Weight:  35 lbs. with 2 hinges</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/9700.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 9700 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n</p>",
